  "notes": {
    "Phase": "0 startup, 1 active, 2 recovery; idle is 0 too. A hold is Phase 1 from frame 2 to 21 (its catch window), then 2 until 33",
    "MoveType": "+0x578: 2 idle/walk, 1 performing any command (strike, throw, hold, guard, sidestep), 3 in hit stun, 5 throw connected (both sides). Coarse; use MoveKind for what the command is",
    "StrikeType": "0 high P, 1 high K, 2 mid P, 5 low K observed; latches after the move like DOA5",
    "HighMidLowGround": "1 high, 2 mid, 3 low observed; latches",
    "CommandCode": "strikes >= 1000 (1000 P, 1100 K, 1120 2K, 1060 6P); throw T = 363 (move 8142, connected 8207/8208, 60 dmg); holds 4H/6H = 168 (moves 155/154, active frames 2..21, recovery to 33); guard = 284 (move 270), crouch guard 285 (move 271); sidestep 326/327 (moves 32/24). Latches (P2 idle kept 1000), and a CPU strike read 254 - not a strike gate",
    "CurrentMove": "per-character move id; P1 (char 21): P=176 K=179 2K=181. Hit reactions on P2: 24169/24073/24008/24167. 0 = idle",
    "CurrentMoveFrame": "1 at move start, +1 per frame; active began at 15 (P), 16 (K, 6P), 18 (2K) for char 21",
    "TotalStartup": "NOT found as a stored field; derive from Phase transitions per (character, move)",
    "Health": "CurrentHealth +0x580 u16: 300 at full; P did 14, K did 16 to char 5; training mode regenerates to 300 within ~1.5 s",
    "verified": "2026-09-14 on DOA6LR.exe (Steam build of that date), Free Training, P1 char 21 vs P2 char 5",
    "Holds": "7H move 152 (code 167), 1H 156 (325), mid hold code 168 with ids 154/155. DOA6 Versus/Free Training has a 'Holds: 3-way / 4-way' setting: in 3-way 4H covers both mids and 6H is a plain guard (move 270); in 4-way 4H = mid punch, 6H = mid kick (DOA5 rule). holdbot --hold-mode must match. Direction and H must be sent in ONE SendInput call; a direction that arrives first turns 7/1 into movement + guard. Catch window: Phase 1 from frame ~4 to ~22 after input",
    "MoveKind": "+0x108 u8 - the DOA5 MoveType equivalent: 3 strike (all four strikes), 16 throw startup, 5 hold, 0 idle/guard/movement. Constant for the whole move. THIS is the strike gate; MoveType +0x578 and CommandCode cannot tell strikes from throws/holds (a CPU strike, move 8026, had CommandCode 254)",
    "InStartup": "+0x1A4 is NOT reliable: read 0 on an idle P1 in a later match. Do not gate on it",
    "P2": "resolved through anchor 'state:P2' (per-side anchors: a field's anchor name plus ':<side>' overrides the shared anchor for that side). The 0x10DFA0 stride seen on 2026-09-14 evening did not survive a character change",
    "BreakGauge": "+0x584 u16 = Break Gauge, CONFIRMED 2026-09-15: at >= 150 the bot's 4S (back + I) came out as the Break Hold (our ids 8407/8409, caught a low kick and a mid punch). Rises by half the damage taken, also on damage dealt in live matches (seen 0..170 on our side). On-screen bars were FULL at 135 (ours) and 172 (theirs): the field keeps counting past full, 100 = full (--gauge-max 100). S alone = Fatal Rush (8399) - the direction must register a frame before S",
    "BreakMeter": "+0x5B4 u16 = the Break Gauge shown on screen. 0..200, 200 = full bar, a match starts at 100, carries over between rounds, Break Hold spends ~100. Confirmed live 2026-09-15 (P1 pinned at 200 with a full bar; P2 104->147 while taking hits). +0x584 is only a running total."
  }
